  "description": "\"WYSIWYG\" (What You See Is What You Get) is a long-established classic in Cinelli’s time trial frame and triathlon lineup. The all‑new WYSIWYG is engineered to minimize frontal area and slice through the wind for maximum speed against the clock. The entire system combines the highly responsive geometry with CFD designed tube profiles and fully integrated elements. The rider can customize the forward‑rotated position—optimizing torso flatness and reducing drag for sustained high‑velocity efforts. This new version adds disc brakes to further enhance stopping power and stability even in the most extreme conditions. A time trial frame designed for experienced riders who demand uncompromising aero performance.",
